                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">CONFORMING FINAL FEM / STAGE 4
After EXTRACT completes, press FINAL FEM. A new TET4 mesh follows the extracted surface.
Supports must cover complete original boundary faces. Loads must remain on the boundary; transfer checks force and moment.
Levels 1: one analysis. Levels 3: sizes h, 0.75h and 0.5625h; compare every case. Three meshes do not automatically imply accuracy.
Use VIEW 4 and select Case / Field above. Stress peaks near concentrated loads may remain mesh dependent.</item>
